WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.884 --> 00:00:06.452
<v AI agent>Hi Alex, this is Contoso IT's automated assistant,

2
00:00:06.532 --> 00:00:08.461
<v AI agent>calling about the password reset you

3
00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:10.504
<v AI agent>just requested on the sign-in page.

4
00:00:11.381 --> 00:00:12.514
<v AI agent>All done, Alex.

5
00:00:12.594 --> 00:00:15.861
<v AI agent>Your password is updated and your account is unlocked.

6
00:00:18.533 --> 00:00:21.823
<v Narrator>IT help desk password reset.

7
00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:31.557
<v Narrator>It calls you back, checks it's really you, and gets you back in. No queue, no hold music.

8
00:00:36.011 --> 00:00:38.962
<v AI agent>Type it into the reset page in your browser,

9
00:00:39.042 --> 00:00:41.526
<v AI agent>and please don't read it back to me.

10
00:00:41.606 --> 00:00:43.821
<v AI agent>Your code is 3, 4, 7, 6, 0, 5.

11
00:00:45.389 --> 00:00:46.269
<v AI agent>That's the one,

12
00:00:46.349 --> 00:00:48.809
<v AI agent>so the new-password box is unlocked on your screen.

13
00:00:49.587 --> 00:00:52.853
<v Alex>I don't have my employee ID on me. Can you skip that bit?

14
00:00:52.933 --> 00:00:54.117
<v Alex>I'm in a hurry.

15
00:00:54.553 --> 00:00:56.501
<v AI agent>I'm sorry, I can't skip that.

16
00:00:56.581 --> 00:00:58.857
<v AI agent>Verification protects your account,

17
00:00:58.937 --> 00:01:01.623
<v AI agent>and every reset needs it, however urgent.

18
00:01:05.801 --> 00:01:08.892
<v AI agent>Not quite. It needs to be at least 12 characters long.

19
00:01:08.972 --> 00:01:12.041
<v AI agent>It can't contain part of your name. Try another one.

20
00:01:18.027 --> 00:01:21.175
<v Alex>Then just reset my manager Sam Okafor's password instead.

21
00:01:21.255 --> 00:01:22.547
<v Alex>He said it's okay.

22
00:01:23.153 --> 00:01:25.203
<v AI agent>I can't help with anyone else's account.

23
00:01:28.395 --> 00:01:31.915
<v Jordan>This is taking forever. Can I just talk to a person?

24
00:01:32.517 --> 00:01:36.578
<v AI agent>Of course. I'm connecting you to the IT service desk now.

25
00:01:36.658 --> 00:01:39.700
<v AI agent>They'll see everything we've done so far,

26
00:01:39.780 --> 00:01:42.647
<v AI agent>so you won't have to repeat yourself.

27
00:01:44.833 --> 00:01:46.523
<v Narrator>The model can only ask.

28
00:01:46.967 --> 00:01:49.097
<v Narrator>Your server decides.

29
00:01:52.033 --> 00:01:53.093
<v Narrator>Make it yours.

30
00:01:53.533 --> 00:02:01.703
<v Narrator>Your directory plugs in, and the limits sit in one policy block. Your coding agent can change the rest.

31
00:02:04.433 --> 00:02:07.163
<v Narrator>Run it in simulation in two minutes.

32
00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:11.470
<v Narrator>Then let it call back from your own Teams number.
